<BaseLayout title="Contact FreeMCP — FreeMCP" description="Contact FreeMCP for listing corrections, questions, partnerships, and sponsorship.">
<article class="container info-page"><div class="eyebrow">FREEMCP / INFORMATION</div><h1>Contact FreeMCP</h1><p class="intro">Contact FreeMCP for listing corrections, questions, partnerships, and sponsorship.</p><div class="info-content"><h2>Questions and partnerships</h2><p>Email <a href="mailto:agents@freemcp.in">agents@freemcp.in</a> for general questions, sponsorships, or partnerships.</p><h2>Listing updates and bug reports</h2><p>For corrections, removal requests, technical issues, or suggestions, open a <a href="https://github.com/strbbrn/freemcp-registry/issues">GitHub issue</a>. Avoid posting passwords, API keys, personal data, or other secrets in public issues.</p><h2>Submit a server</h2><p>To propose a new listing, use the <a href="/submit/">submission form</a> rather than emailing credentials or private source code.</p></div></article>
</BaseLayout>
